WEBVTT

34:02.317 --> 34:04.193
Illyrio's no fool.

34:04.319 --> 34:06.112
He knows I won't forget my friends

34:06.237 --> 34:08.489
when I come into my throne.

34:12.827 --> 34:14.579
You still slouch.

34:18.958 --> 34:21.252
Let them see.

34:24.047 --> 34:26.799
You have a woman's body now.

34:29.761 --> 34:31.471
(SIGHS)
